AI model weights (not included in this repository; downloaded at runtime)

IS-Net "isnet-general-use" model weights
  From "Highly Accurate Dichotomous Image Segmentation", Xuebin Qin, Hang Dai,
  Xiaobin Hu, Deng-Ping Fan, Ling Shao, Luc Van Gool, ECCV 2022.
  https://github.com/xuebinqin/DIS (code: Apache License 2.0).
  The browser app downloads an fp16 ONNX export from
  https://huggingface.co/imgly/isnet-general-onnx (the repository is tagged
  MIT by img.ly); the Python reference downloads the same weights through rembg.
  The weights are NOT covered by this project's MIT license. The upstream
  authors do not state a license for the weights; the DIS5K training dataset
  is restricted to non-commercial research and educational use. Check upstream
  terms before commercial use.

